  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Health Systems Support Program Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tonga Health Systems Support Program Phase 2 (THSSP 2) supports the Government of Tonga to improve health service delivery, with a strong focus on non-communicable diseases (NCDs). The program aligns to the Ministry of Health Corporate Plan 2015-2020, Tonga Strategic Development Framework II, and the National Strategy to Prevent and Control NCDs 2010 &#x2013; 2015. The overarching objective is for a more effective, efficient and equitable preventative and primary care service for the Tongan population. The program is implemented through earmarked budget support, grants and technical assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
